<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Outback Steakhouse cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Outback Steakhouse cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown on Friday sliced its rating for Outback Steakhouse Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Tampa, Fla., restaurant chain opened down 4-5/8 to 19 in very heavy trading.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
